{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_84","type":"agent_message","text":"A further issue is in the initializer itself: each 4096-value output tile was also evaluating a 4096-lane masked LSE store, even though LSE has only 32 values per query. I’m remapping it to exactly one output row plus its 32 LSE values per workgroup, eliminating nearly all masked-store overhead."}}
